  "semantic_rules": [
    "source and recipient must be distinct current Devices in one exact Root-signed Account roster",
    "the Account owning that roster must be a member of the exact Root-signed conversation membership",
    "the recipient signs the bounded range request and an explicit session binding",
    "the manifest commits the complete ordered Event ID inventory while each bundle carries one contiguous range",
    "every entry carries one fully verified authorized RatchetText event and is signed by the source Device",
    "each HPKE AAD binds manifest ID, exact inventory index and Event ID",
